|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|x_{0,4}, x_{1,4}, x_{2,4}, x_{3,4}, x_{0,1,2,3}, x_{0,1,2,4}, x_{0,1,3,4},   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|x_{0,2,3,4}, x_{1,2,3,4}]                                                    |
