Forward -- propagate weights from domain to codomain
****************************************************

Description
===========

Set this argument to true to ensure weights are propagated forward along a map
of graded free modules, i.e., from domain to the codomain of the map. The
default setting is false meaning that weights are propagated backwards, i.e.,
from codomain to domain.

See also
========

  * *note propagateWeights: propagateWeights, -- propagate (Lie theoretic)
    weights along equivariant maps

