    semisimple Lie group action
  * "highestWeightsDecomposition(Ideal,ZZ,ZZ)" -- see *note
    highestWeightsDecomposition(Ideal,List):
    highestWeightsDecomposition_lpIdeal_cmList_rp, -- decompose an ideal with a
    semisimple Lie group action
  * *note highestWeightsDecomposition(Module,List,List):
    highestWeightsDecomposition_lpModule_cmList_cmList_rp, -- decompose a
    module with a semisimple Lie group action
